sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant C as cycle
    participant T as TWS (paper)
    participant F as Files
    participant D as Dashboard
    loop every 5 min in market hours
        S->>C: run
        C->>T: positions, prices
        C->>C: manage stops, partials, 15:51 close
        C->>C: scan watchlist (D1-D3, I1-I3)
        C->>T: place order + stop
        C->>F: trades.csv, positions, decision log
    end
    D->>F: read through serve-api every 30 s
